  "headline": "Pegfilgrastim is not on FDA's shortage list; Corvale East has 14.6 days on hand and Corvale General has 27.4 days on hand",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "D1", "D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show pegfilgrastim is not on the drug shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 41 syringes of the 6 mg/0.6 mL presentation with 14.6 days on hand at current use.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 157 syringes of the same presentation with 27.4 days on hand at current use.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A label for an Amneal product names Kashiv BioSciences, LLC (FEI 3011289655) as the registered manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That plant received a VAI classification on 2024-06-14 (known 2024-08-16) and an OAI classification on 2018-01-26 (known 2018-02-16).",
      "cites": ["E6", "E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked purchasing option is Accord BioPharma, Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and whose label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Secondary options are Biocon Biologics Inc. and Coherus Oncology, Inc., also not on the shortage list and with no placeable plant on their labels.",
      "cites": ["D5", "D6"]
    }
  ]
}
